    {
      "ref": "R488",
      "area": "content",
      "claim": "A parent reports the home button exits a lesson without confirmation, causing loss of progress and frustration for young children.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Great app with lots of content across reading, writing, math, general knowledge. My one big complaint is that during each lesson there is a home icon button that exits out of the current lesson with no confirmation. You lose your progress and can’t immediately open the lesson back up (unless you find it in the library). Another random lesson opens. This happens so often with my young kids, and it’s so frustrating."
    },
